issue.body:
For the following mapping

```
          "byte_field": {
             "type": "byte",
             "ignore_malformed": true,
             "fields": {
               "integer_subfield": {
                 "type": "integer"
               }
             }
           }
```

And a test value that makes use of the `ignore_malformed` property in the `byte` field - `123456789`, asking for the `byte_field.integer_subfield` value generates an error:

```
{
    "fields": [
        {
            "field": "byte_field.integer_subfield"
        }
    ]
}
```

```
{
    "error": {
        "root_cause": [
            {
                "type": "illegal_argument_exception",
                "reason": "Value [123456789] is out of range for a byte"
            }
        ],
        "type": "search_phase_execution_exception",
        "reason": "all shards failed",
        "phase": "query",
        "grouped": true,
        "failed_shards": [
            {
                "shard": 0,
                "index": "test",
                "node": "JVVbzLD1TEi0XEOp56FBqg",
                "reason": {
                    "type": "illegal_argument_exception",
                    "reason": "Value [123456789] is out of range for a byte"
                }
            }
        ],
        "caused_by": {
            "type": "illegal_argument_exception",
            "reason": "Value [123456789] is out of range for a byte",
            "caused_by": {
                "type": "illegal_argument_exception",
                "reason": "Value [123456789] is out of range for a byte"
            }
        }
    },
    "status": 400
}
```

Given the mapping:

```
{
	"mappings": {
          "properties": {
            "text_field": {
             "type": "text",
             "fields": {
               "keyword_subfield": {
                 "type": "keyword",
                 "ignore_above": 10
               }
             }
           }
	 }
	}
}
```

and test data like:

```
{"index":{}}
{"text_field" : "1234567890 asdlkfjasdf"}
{"index":{}}
{"text_field" : "foo"}
```

For a query of the form:

```
{
    "size": 1000,
    "_source": false,
    "fields": [
        {
            "field": "text_field"
        },
        {
            "field": "text_field.keyword_subfield"
        }
    ]
}
```

The output shows a value for the `keyword_subfield`  which, according to `ignore_above: 10` should have no value:

```
        "hits": [
            {
                "_index": "test",
                "_id": "Zq3O4nMBFdprR7a5qr4z",
                "_score": 1,
                "fields": {
                    "text_field.keyword_subfield": [
                        "1234567890 asdlkfjasdf"
                    ],
                    "text_field": [
                        "1234567890 asdlkfjasdf"
                    ]
                }
            },
            {
                "_index": "test",
                "_id": "Z63O4nMBFdprR7a5qr40",
                "_score": 1,
                "fields": {
                    "text_field.keyword_subfield": [
                        "foo"
                    ],
                    "text_field": [
                        "foo"
                    ]
                }
            }
        ]
```
